Roost
Your PC, from anywhere.
https://github.com/Just-Rice/perch

Roost is built on Perch, created by Just-Rice (https://github.com/Just-Rice/perch), and is distributed under the
same licence, the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The protocol (docs/PROTOCOL.md), the host (host/), the code shared by the website and the host (site/js/shared/), the
relays (relay/), the website's connection, sign-in and viewer logic, and the tests come from Perch. Roost has modified
them: ported to Windows, renamed, and given a new design. roost.exe (app/) is new in Roost; parts of its design follow
Perch's Mac app.

Third-party components and their licences are listed in THIRD_PARTY.md.
